        "edit": "Replace the sum assignment `assign s=(a|b|ci);` with the correct XOR-based full-adder sum `assign s=(a^b^ci);`. The carry logic is already correct; only the sum expression was wrong (OR instead of XOR), causing the observed output mismatches.",
